{
    "word": "patchwork",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1bc153fd-8c95-36c9-84d6-9b13ac011709",
                "word": "patchwork",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "abebc7c9-fa72-493e-aeca-ac118538b791",
                        "entry_id": "1bc153fd-8c95-36c9-84d6-9b13ac011709",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "patchworks"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fe3c4878-f60a-3575-a264-d19d47881636",
                        "entry_id": "1bc153fd-8c95-36c9-84d6-9b13ac011709",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A work, such as a blanket, composed of many different colors and shapes, sewn together to make an interesting whole."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd9eeaff-2268-3511-b7e6-e2ad7314f9c5",
                        "entry_id": "1bc153fd-8c95-36c9-84d6-9b13ac011709",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any kind of creation that makes use of many different aspects to create one whole piece."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "figuratively",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d854460-57e0-472b-8b60-b83788710557",
                                "sense_id": "cd9eeaff-2268-3511-b7e6-e2ad7314f9c5",
                                "text": "Bill took all of his poetry and put it together in a folder. It made up a patchwork of his life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4292ace1-8fa1-4024-a170-15f252845e92",
                                "sense_id": "cd9eeaff-2268-3511-b7e6-e2ad7314f9c5",
                                "text": "Everything about China is super-sized: The five new parks, which in some cases stitched together an older patchwork of conservation zones, sprawl across more than 88,800 square miles of territory—a protected area more than 25 times the size of Yellowstone National Park in the United States."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07b9c4c7-1a04-4a1a-8cb7-26c7d5945992",
                                "sense_id": "cd9eeaff-2268-3511-b7e6-e2ad7314f9c5",
                                "text": "The wider North West and Central Region is itself a microcosm of the industry's complexity. Covering the approaches to London Euston, stretching through Birmingham and the West Midlands, and reaching Manchester, Liverpool and beyond, it is a patchwork of overlapping markets, political geographies, and infrastructure types."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aebc3e48-e419-3373-98a7-9be715ab4334",
                        "entry_id": "1bc153fd-8c95-36c9-84d6-9b13ac011709",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A state of regulations whose constituents have an opaque scope of application because of their questionable delimitation with regard to each other."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "derogatory",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c161a1e0-7533-4083-ae10-de500f6f8407",
                                "sense_id": "aebc3e48-e419-3373-98a7-9be715ab4334",
                                "text": "Present United States privacy law – despite being made up of a patchwork federal and state constitutional, statutory, and common law – is predominantly based on the ideals of individual control, autonomy, and liberty from governmental intrusion, despite the fact that its inspiration was an idea grounded on the importance of protecting human dignity and an “inviolate personality.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e35d9a2d-dbef-4487-844a-0d44c879e07c",
                                "sense_id": "aebc3e48-e419-3373-98a7-9be715ab4334",
                                "text": "Proponents of an AI moratorium had argued that a patchwork of state and local AI laws is hindering progress in the AI industry and the ability of U.S. firms to compete with China."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "65935ce6-af6c-4c64-8903-d73889e93771",
                        "source_entry_id": "1bc153fd-8c95-36c9-84d6-9b13ac011709",
                        "source_sense_description": "a work composed of many different colors and shapes",
                        "target_lang_word": "lapwerk",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lapwerk",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44faeb89-aac3-362d-b108-31719bbb2309",
                                        "entry_id": "f27ae42e-0d1c-3e3b-af1a-1be3bc2d1250",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "provisorische reparaties"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a6b8a7c-de6b-4df3-adf9-cf70b51e4433",
                                                "sense_id": "44faeb89-aac3-362d-b108-31719bbb2309",
                                                "text": "De gemeente Hengelo moet momenteel heel wat lapwerk verrichten aan wegen door vorstschade. Inmiddels zijn op twintig wegen en vier fietspaden één of meerdere gaten ontdekt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ee6174e-f461-4943-8858-f46885d247c9",
                                                "sense_id": "44faeb89-aac3-362d-b108-31719bbb2309",
                                                "text": "Maar volgens de partijen ontstaat er zo een \"lapwerk\" waarmee het kabinet de luchthaven wil beschermen. D66-Kamerlid Salima Belhaj wil dat er in september een structurele oplossing is voor de beveiliging van Schiphol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea168905-dc28-44ba-b6b9-1715a65ee903",
                                                "sense_id": "44faeb89-aac3-362d-b108-31719bbb2309",
                                                "text": "Met lapwerk en financiële injecties wordt nu een zorgsector overeind gehouden waar we ooit trots op waren. Niet alleen ouderen maar ook zorgverleners hebben geleden. Zij holden van de ene reorganisatie naar de andere, werden opgescheept met loodzware taken. Bovendien kregen ze niet de waardering die zij verdienden, want het is vooral aan hen te danken dat de ouderenzorg nog functioneert."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c66e6ad4-0d42-4bc5-b0d3-2a1603fd1a62",
                        "source_entry_id": "1bc153fd-8c95-36c9-84d6-9b13ac011709",
                        "source_sense_description": "a work composed of many different colors and shapes",
                        "target_lang_word": "lappendeken",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lappendeken",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3d5ac70-4394-31cd-a5d6-7fed21aa637b",
                                        "entry_id": "5ae59a07-8c7b-33b3-8270-9df01ee4db97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een deken gemaakt uit verschillende losse delen die aan elkaar gestikt zijn"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d622cb3-c586-45ff-8d9c-e775a3d1edb2",
                                                "sense_id": "e3d5ac70-4394-31cd-a5d6-7fed21aa637b",
                                                "text": "Mitjenka's vrouw en haar zusters staken in het voorhuis hun verschrikte gezichten om de deur van hun kamer, waar een glanzende samowar stoomde en het hoge met een lappendeken bedekte bed van de rentmeester stond"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7b7dee0-17e6-369a-a827-9b746a8fed2b",
                                        "entry_id": "5ae59a07-8c7b-33b3-8270-9df01ee4db97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een bont onsamenhangend geheel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52f19288-f556-42c9-9913-8e770deeb60e",
                                                "sense_id": "a7b7dee0-17e6-369a-a827-9b746a8fed2b",
                                                "text": "Het gevolg daarvan is dat de komende acht weken 30.000 Syriërs vanuit belegerde dorpen en steden naar elders moeten worden gebracht. Vanwege de lappendeken aan strijdende partijen gaat de reis vaak dwars door vijandelijk gebied."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "894a637d-c151-4658-80f5-e0ee1943025e",
                                                "sense_id": "a7b7dee0-17e6-369a-a827-9b746a8fed2b",
                                                "text": "De Koerdische oud-minister neemt Bagdad een manifest gebrek aan wil om de vernielde stad op te bouwen kwalijk. Hij twijfelt er ook aan of Mosul, een (gewezen) lappendeken van etnieën en religieuze gezindheden, nog tot zoiets als verzoening kan komen. De woede van Christenen, Jezidi’s, Koerden en anderen is gericht op de soennitische meerderheid: IS is een salafistische, fundamentalistisch soennitische, beweging."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d7c3a294-76bb-4244-9b27-b9b562d96152",
